      "name": "Icon Card Blocks",
      "settings": {
        "page_width": "container",
        "subheading": "Find your tea",
        "heading": "Don't shop by herb. Shop by <em>how you want to feel.<\/em>",
        "heading_size": "hxl",
        "text": "<p>You don't need to know your linden from your lemon balm. Tell us what your body's asking for, and we'll point you to the wild herbs traditionally trusted for it.<\/p>",
        "columns": 3,
